Package: qvdr
Title: Read QVD Files from QlikView and Qlik Sense
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jasper", "Cain", email = "jcainsecondemail@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Jasper Cain [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jasper Cain <jcainsecondemail@gmail.com>
Description: Reads QVD (QlikView Data) binary files into R data frames or
    tibbles. QVD is a proprietary binary format used by QlikView and Qlik Sense
    for high-performance data storage. This package parses the XML header,
    symbol table, and bit-stuffed record matrix, with a high-performance C++
    backend via Rcpp for fast bit extraction. Supports all symbol types
    including integers, doubles, strings, and dual values.
